<doc id="94967" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=94967" title="Franz Josef I saka Ostenrik">
Franz Josef I saka Ostenrik

Franz Josef I (basa liyane Franz Joseph; #ALIH) iku Kaisar &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Austria&lt;/a&gt; lan Raja &lt;a href="Bohemia"&gt;Bohemia&lt;/a&gt; saka taun &lt;a href="1848"&gt;1848&lt;/a&gt; tekan taun &lt;a href="1916"&gt;1916&lt;/a&gt;, sarta Raja Apostolik &lt;a href="Honggari"&gt;Hongaria&lt;/a&gt; saka 1867 tekan taun 1916. Dhèwèké asalé saka &lt;a href="Habsburg"&gt;Wangsa Habsburg&lt;/a&gt;.
Putra pambarepé &lt;a href="Franz%20Karl%20saka%20Ostenrik"&gt;Franz Karl&lt;/a&gt;, saduluré Kaisar &lt;a href="Ferdinand%201%20saka%20austria"&gt;Ferdinand 1 saka Austria&lt;/a&gt;, Franz Joseph uga kakangné Kaisar &lt;a href="Maximilian%20I%20saka%20Meksiko"&gt;Maximilian I saka Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika umur 13 taun dhèwèké miwiti pakaryan minangka &lt;a href="kolon%C3%A8l"&gt;kolonèl&lt;/a&gt; ing angkatan bersenjata Austria. Dhèwèké dadi Kaisar Austria nalika Ferdinand lengser keprabon nalika pungkasan &lt;a href="Revolusi%201848"&gt;Revolusi 1848&lt;/a&gt; kang dumadi ing tanggal &lt;a href="2%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;2 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1848"&gt;1848&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="1854"&gt;1854&lt;/a&gt;, Franz Josef palakrama karo &lt;a href="Elizabeth%20saka%20Bayern"&gt;Putri Elizabeth saka Bayern&lt;/a&gt;. Anak lanang siji-sijine(ontang antinge), &lt;a href="Rudolf%20saka%20Ostenrik-Honggari"&gt;Putra Makutha Rudolf&lt;/a&gt;, nglalu nalika taun &lt;a href="1889"&gt;1889&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20I"&gt;Perang Donya I&lt;/a&gt; pecah, &lt;a href="Ostenrik-Honggari"&gt;Austria-Hongaria&lt;/a&gt; sabyantu karo &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, nanging tentarané jebul ora duwé kasiapan lan piranti kang cukup. Salah siji sababe ya iku watake Franz Josef kang konservatif. Dhèwèké nulak supaya para tentara entuk senjata kang anyar (yaiku, &lt;a href="tank"&gt;tank&lt;/a&gt;).
Katelu anak liyané ya iku &lt;a href="Sophie%20Friederike%20saka%20Ostenrik"&gt;Sophie Friederike&lt;/a&gt; (1855 - 1858), &lt;a href="Gisela%20saka%20Ostenrik"&gt;Gisela&lt;/a&gt; (1856 - 1932), lan &lt;a href="Marie%20Valerie%20saka%20Ostenrik-Honggari"&gt;Marie Valerie&lt;/a&gt; (1868 - 1924).

