Toei Animation

Toei Animation (東映アニメーション, Tōei Animēshon) () Ya iku jeneg salah sijiné studio &lt;a href="anime"&gt;animasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; kang diduwèni déning perusahaan &lt;a href="Toei%20Company"&gt;Toei Company&lt;/a&gt;. Studio animasi iki diyasa taun &lt;a href="1956"&gt;1956&lt;/a&gt;, lan awit iku Toei wis gawé pira-pira judhul filem animasi.
Film animasi pertama ing Toei Animation ya iku &lt;a href="The%20White%20Snake%20Enchantress"&gt;The White Snake Enchantress&lt;/a&gt; (Hakuja-Den, 1958), lan serial anime pertama ing studio iki ya iku &lt;a href="Ookami%20Shonen%20Ken"&gt;Ookami Shonen Ken&lt;/a&gt; (1963). Ing taun &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;, Toei Animation wiwit produksi serial anime karya &lt;a href="Shotaro%20Ishinomori"&gt;Shotaro Ishinomori&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta &lt;a href="Rainbow%20Sentai%20Robin"&gt;Rainbow Sentai Robin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kaizoku%20Ouji"&gt;Kaizoku Ouji&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cyborg%20009"&gt;Cyborg 009&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Genshi%20Shounen%20Ryuu"&gt;Genshi Shounen Ryuu&lt;/a&gt;. Awit taun &lt;a href="1972"&gt;1972&lt;/a&gt;, Toei Animation produksi serial anime karya &lt;a href="Go%20Nagai"&gt;Go Nagai&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu &lt;a href="Devilman"&gt;Devilman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mazinger%20Z"&gt;Mazinger Z&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cutey%20Honey"&gt;Cutey Honey&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="UFO%20Robot%20Grendizer"&gt;UFO Robot Grendizer&lt;/a&gt;.
Studio iki sadurungé dikenal kanti jeneng Toei Doga (東映動画 Tōei Dōga) nganti taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt; sadurungé ahiré mutusaké kanggo ngganti jeneng dadi Toei Animation.
