American Broadcasting Company

American Broadcasting Company (ABC) ya iku &lt;a href="stasiun%20televisi"&gt;stasiun televisi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="stasiun%20radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang diyasa nalika taun 1943 kanti pecahé saka jaringan radio &lt;a href="NBC"&gt;NBC&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Blue%20Network"&gt;Blue Network&lt;/a&gt;. ABC diduwèni déning &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;The Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt; lan wujud pérangan saka &lt;a href="Disney-ABC%20Television%20Group"&gt;Disney-ABC Television Group&lt;/a&gt;, sadurungé ABC-TV. ABC wiwit disiaraké ing TV nalika taun 1948. Kantor pusat perusahaané manggon ana ing &lt;a href="Manhattan"&gt;Manhattan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;, sawentara departemen-departemen rencanane berbasis ing &lt;a href="Burbank%2C%20California"&gt;Burbank, California&lt;/a&gt;, cepke &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios"&gt;Studio Walt Disney&lt;/a&gt; lan kantor pusat perusahaan &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;The Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt;. ABC wujud jaringan TV kang paling kerep ditonton nalika taun 2008.
