Cirrus Airlines Luftfahrtgesellschaft mbH ya iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="maskap%C3%A9%20pamaburan"&gt;maskapé pamaburan&lt;/a&gt; kang panggonané ana ing &lt;a href="Saarbr%C3%BCcken"&gt;Saarbrücken&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Maskapé iki ngoperasikaké penerbangan charter lan kanti jadwal, kang sebanjuré dadi pérangan saka &lt;a href="Lufthansa"&gt;Lufthansa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Switserlan%20International%20Air%20Lines"&gt;Switserlan International Air Lines&lt;/a&gt;. Basis mligi ya iku ing &lt;a href="Saarbr%C3%BCcken"&gt;Saarbrücken&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Saarbr%C3%BCcken"&gt;SCN&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Cirrus didegake nalika wulan Fèbruari 1995 minangka Cirrus Luftfahrtgesellschaft mbH lan beroperasi minangka maskapé charter bisnis èksekutif. Nalika wulan Maret 1998, Cirrus Airlines nampa lisensi kanggo ngoperasikan penerbangan kanttti jadwal antaranene &lt;a href="Saarbr%C3%BCcken"&gt;Saarbrücken&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Hamburg"&gt;Hamburg&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika wulan Agustus 1999, Cirrus mengambil alih rute &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Mannheim%20City"&gt;Papan Anggegana Mannheim City&lt;/a&gt; tumuju &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Internasional%20Tempelhof"&gt;Tempelhof&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Cosmos%20Air"&gt;Cosmos Air&lt;/a&gt;.
Salah sijiné langkah wigati dilakokake nalika wulan Fèbruari 2000, nalika karaméan 5 taun Cirrus Airlines, ing ngendi maskapé ngresmikake kerjasama kooperatif karo maskapé penerbangan duwéné Jerman, Lufthansa lan dadi anggota tim waralaba &lt;a href="Team%20Lufthansa"&gt;Team Lufthansa&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika wulan April taun kang pada, Cirrus nampa lisensi kanggo beroperasi kanti jadwal kanthi reguler antaranene &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Mannheim%20City"&gt;Papan Anggegana Mannheim City&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Hamburg"&gt;Hamburg&lt;/a&gt; lan antarané&lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sylt"&gt;Sylt&lt;/a&gt;/Westerland. Awit taun 2001, Cirrus kanthi tetep ngembangaké bisnisé, kanti penerbangan nganggo jadwal dibuka antarané &lt;a href="Saarbr%C3%BCcken"&gt;Saarbrücken&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Internasional%20Tempelhof"&gt;Tempelhof&lt;/a&gt; (Maret 2001), antarané &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Internasional%20Tempelhof"&gt;Tempelhof&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Heringsdorf"&gt;Papan Anggegana Heringsdorf&lt;/a&gt; ing pulo &lt;a href="Usedom"&gt;Usedom&lt;/a&gt; (Mèi 2002), antarané &lt;a href="Rostock"&gt;Rostock&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Munich"&gt;Munich&lt;/a&gt; (Mèi 2002), antarané &lt;a href="Leipzig"&gt;Leipzig&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="Halle%2C%20Saxony-Anhalt"&gt;Halle&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Z%C3%BCrich"&gt;Zürich&lt;/a&gt; (Januari 2003), antarané &lt;a href="Leipzig"&gt;Leipzig&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="Halle%2C%20Saxony-Anhalt"&gt;Halle&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Hamburg"&gt;Hamburg&lt;/a&gt; (Januari 2003), antarané &lt;a href="Dresden"&gt;Dresden&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Hamburg"&gt;Hamburg&lt;/a&gt; (Maret 2003), antarané &lt;a href="Frankfurt"&gt;Frankfurt&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Skopje"&gt;Skopje&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Republik%20Makedonia"&gt;Makedonia&lt;/a&gt; (April 2003), antarané &lt;a href="Leipzig"&gt;Leipzig&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="Halle%2C%20Saxony-Anhalt"&gt;Halle&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cologne"&gt;Cologne&lt;/a&gt; (Mèi 2003), antarané &lt;a href="Frankfurt"&gt;Frankfurt&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ohrid"&gt;Ohrid&lt;/a&gt; (Juni 2003), antarané &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Mannheim%20City"&gt;Papan Anggegana Mannheim City&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dresden"&gt;Dresden&lt;/a&gt; (Maret 2004), antarané &lt;a href="Dresden"&gt;Dresden&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Z%C3%BCrich"&gt;Zürich&lt;/a&gt; (April 2004), antarané &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Mannheim%20City"&gt;Papan Anggegana Mannheim City&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Olbia"&gt;Olbia&lt;/a&gt; (Mèi 2004) lan antarané &lt;a href="Munich"&gt;Munich&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20London%20City"&gt;London City&lt;/a&gt; (Mèi 2004), antarané &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Mannheim%20City"&gt;Papan Anggegana Mannheim City&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Munich"&gt;Munich&lt;/a&gt; (September 2008).
Cirrus Airlines ya iku perusahaan saka Aviation Investment Corp. Kang uga ngambah Cirrus Maintenance, Cirrus Service lan nana tours. Grup iki ngoperasikake 11 pesawat lan punjul 400 karyawan. Perusahaan ngenalake modifikasi identitas perusahaan wulan Januari 2008.
